    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**DNG 3D VIRTUAL TOUR OF THIS PROPERTY AVAILABLE** \n\nExceptionally well maintained three bedroomed semi-detached family residence, (c. 1,270 sq. ft. 118sq.m.) excluding garage (13 sq.m. - 140 sq.ft.). Accommodation comprises lounge, dining room, kitchen, utility room, downstairs w.h.b. & w.c. and garage. \n\nClose to the junction of Ballyroan Road & Ballyboden Road within two kilometres of Rathfarnham Village, close to local parks including St Enda's and Marlay and less than five minutes to M50 interchange at Scholarstown. Convenient to a selection of excellent primary & secondary schools, shopping facilities, public transport routes (15B, 74 & S8) are close by. \n\nThere are private mature rear gardens and patio c.60 ft. Gas fired central heating, double glazed windows, carpets, curtains, and blinds are included in the sale."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Porch - \nTiled flooring\n\nEntrance Hallway - 2.7m x 1.7m\nPolished timber flooring & cloakroom\n\nDining Room - 3.86m x 3.59m\nMarble fireplace and polished timber flooring\n\nLounge - 4.50m x 3.20m\nMarble fireplace & mahogany surround and polished timber flooring. Patio doors to garden\n\nKitchen - 3.30m x 4.11\nLarge selection of pine fitted presses, cooker, hob, extractor, dishwasher & fridge\n\nUtility Room - \nWith w.c. & w.h.b., plumbed for washing machine\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.50m x 3.54m\nBuilt in wardrobes with t&g polished flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.86m x 3.12m\nBuilt in wardrobes with t&g polished flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.67m x 2.70m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.30m x 2.28m\nWalk in shower w.c. & w.h.b. fully tiled walls & floors\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Garage 5.00m x 2.60m</li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li> Double Glazed Windows</li><li> Burglar Alarm</li><li> Cobble-lock driveway with off Street Parking</li><li> Carpets, Drapes and Blinds</li><li> Outside Tap.</li><li> Mature Walled Rear Garden & Patio 60ft.</li><li> Floor Area c. (1,270sq.ft. 118sq.m.)</ul>"
      },
